text:
Backport "HBASE-24914 Remove duplicate code appearing continuously in method ReplicationPeerManager.updatePeerConfig" to branch-2. Branch-2/ Branch-2.4/Branch-2.5 also have duplicate code in ReplicationPeerManager#updatePeerConfig


newPeerConfigBuilder.putAllConfiguration(oldPeerConfig.getConfiguration());
newPeerConfigBuilder.putAllConfiguration(peerConfig.getConfiguration());
