RegionReplicationSink.send set timeout for replicating meta edits error. HBASE-26539 introduce separate {{RegionReplicationSink.metaEditRpcTimeoutNs}} and {{RegionReplicationSink.metaEditOperationTimeoutNs}} for replicating meta edits, but seems in {{RegionReplicationSink.send}} set timeout is erroneous:
{code:java}
     if (hasMetaEdit) {
      rpcTimeoutNsToUse = rpcTimeoutNs;
      operationTimeoutNsToUse = operationTimeoutNs;
